pkg:Evidence_v1_42_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.42.0 (STORY-18: real WSJF-scored decision against pipeline BRSF reconfiguration)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: recorded a real, WSJF-scored decision (0.7) against reconfiguring the in-browser agentic pipeline to persist governed records into this register, requested explicitly by the owner as a grounded cost-benefit/risk-opportunity analysis. The score's own rationale names the deciding factor: automating evidenceVerified claims from the pipeline's own small-local-model output risks writing false governance records, demonstrated concretely by that same model's real failure earlier this session (regurgitating remedy instructions instead of writing code). Recorded as a real Proposed, scored Story rather than conversational advice. Re-verified: pipeline order PASS (62 subjects, reproduces), register CONFORMANT (0 violations)."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "4c934f8d0ae96ff1d4e848b47db0255c57157e46937eba588482662754908f4f"^^xsd:string .
